apply_page.faq_photos_a:
You do not need to pay for a professional portfolio/book. We prefer natural photos taken with a smartphone. Avoid: selfies, back-facing photos, sunglasses, or other accessories.

To take good photos, find a neutral-colored wall, during the day with natural light, no makeup, no photo editing, and no filters – we want to see your natural beauty. Wear a basic plain white or black t-shirt and jeans (heels for female applicants).

Make sure to take photos:
• Full-body and half-body;
• Profile (side angle);
• Close-up of your face – smiling and without smiling.
